{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45031","headline":"春日和卢使君幼平开元寺听妙奘上人讲 · 皎然","name":"春日和卢使君幼平开元寺听妙奘上人讲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁圣垂文在，虚空日月悬。\n陵迟追哲匠，宗旨发幽诠。\n法受诸侯请，心教四子传。\n春生雪山草，香下棘林天。\n顾我从今日，闻经悟宿缘。\n凉山万里去，应爲教犹偏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}